#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Isto elimina de verdade estes ficheiros deste ordenador: as contas de usuario e os contrasinais (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), a lista de discos (/etc/fstab), as regras de inicio de sesión (/etc/pam.d) e as regras de administrador (/etc/sudoers). Os seus propios ficheiros e aplicacións non se tocan.\n"
"\n"
"Garde o seu traballo e peche antes as aplicacións: o ordenador reiníciase en canto se eliminan.\n"
"\n"
"Se a restauración non funciona: cando un arranque quede colgado ou siga estragado, manteña premido o botón de acendido ata que o ordenador se apague, e despois acéndao. Despois de 2 arranques fallidos, o seguinte arranque é a versión anterior gardada para Desfacer a última actualización, que ten a súa propia copia destas opcións."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Cando volva, unha mensaxe indica que a proba funcionou, e elimínase a copia de proba. Non apague o ordenador durante a proba salvo que os pasos o digan. {save}\n"
"\n"
"A copia de proba ocupa o lugar da versión anterior gardada para Desfacer a última actualización, así que Desfacer non ten a onde volver ata a próxima actualización."

