msgstr "Engadir traducións a 68 idiomas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Make every screen's text translatable"
msgstr "Facer traducible o texto de todas as pantallas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Let apps and ports in per place; Work lets nothing in"
msgstr "Permitir aplicacións e portos segundo o lugar; Traballo non deixa entrar nada"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add light and dark schedule, slideshow and fonts"
msgstr "Engadir horario claro e escuro, presentación e tipos de letra"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Rename System Tools to EvenKeelOS Wheelhouse"
msgstr "Cambiar o nome de Ferramentas do sistema a EvenKeelOS Wheelhouse"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Show NVIDIA graphics as fine in the fit check"
msgstr "Mostrar os gráficos NVIDIA como correctos na comprobación de compatibilidade"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Load the file systems before installing"
msgstr "Cargar os sistemas de ficheiros antes de instalar"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ask before an automatic restart"
msgstr "Preguntar antes dun reinicio automático"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Mark every new version for trial"
msgstr "Marcar cada versión nova para proba"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Roll back an update when something that worked breaks"
msgstr "Reverter unha actualización cando deixa de funcionar algo que funcionaba"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start every build in a virtual machine before publishing"
msgstr "Iniciar cada compilación nunha máquina virtual antes de publicala"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recommend 8 GB of memory, with no minimum"
msgstr "Recomendar 8 GB de memoria, sen mínimo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Check the computer before installing from the live USB"
msgstr "Comprobar o equipo antes de instalar desde o USB en vivo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ask Windows or Linux user in the installer"
msgstr "Preguntar no instalador se es usuario de Windows ou de Linux"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add System Tools to the logo menu"
msgstr "Engadir Ferramentas do sistema ao menú do logotipo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add six more topics to the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Engadir seis temas máis á guía de EvenKeelOS"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Turn New to Linux into the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Converter Novo en Linux na guía de EvenKeelOS"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add the New to Linux guide in System Tools and at login"
msgstr "Engadir a guía Novo en Linux en Ferramentas do sistema e ao iniciar sesión"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Boot options: common fixes and your own settings"
msgstr "Engadir Opcións de arranque: solucións comúns e os teus propios axustes"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the Shared folders build check: no home folders yet"
msgstr "Corrixir a comprobación de compilación de Cartafoles compartidos: aínda non hai cartafoles persoais"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Shared folders: share home folders on Home networks"
msgstr "Engadir Cartafoles compartidos: compartir cartafoles persoais en redes de tipo Casa"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Network safety: Home, Work or Public place"
msgstr "Engadir Seguranza da rede: Casa, Traballo ou Lugar público"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize printer drivers in any folder"
msgstr "Recoñecer controladores de impresora en calquera cartafol"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Show tool windows inside System Tools"
msgstr "Mostrar as xanelas de ferramentas dentro de Ferramentas do sistema"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open an issue when the image build fails"
msgstr "Abrir unha incidencia cando falla a compilación da imaxe"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Lock outside packages and the ISO tool to exact versions"
msgstr "Fixar os paquetes externos e a ferramenta de ISO a versións exactas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Name tool windows after the tool, shorter test list"
msgstr "Poñerlles ás xanelas de ferramentas o nome da ferramenta, lista de probas máis curta"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Repair deleted system settings and alert on certificates"
msgstr "Reparar axustes do sistema borrados e avisar sobre certificados"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put every tool in one System Tools window"
msgstr "Reunir todas as ferramentas nunha soa xanela de Ferramentas do sistema"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Leave nothing behind when a VPN is removed"
msgstr "Non deixar nada atrás ao eliminar unha VPN"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Get a VPN, with VPNs that keep updating"
msgstr "Engadir Obter unha VPN, con VPN que seguen actualizándose"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Give Zoom meetings their own guide"
msgstr "Dar ás reunións de Zoom a súa propia guía"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open Zoom meetings in Chrome, in Zoom's web version"
msgstr "Abrir as reunións de Zoom en Chrome, na versión web de Zoom"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Stop ArtCraft installs from breaking Flathub installs"
msgstr "Evitar que as instalacións de ArtCraft rompan as de Flathub"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize installers by their usual file name"
msgstr "Recoñecer instaladores polo seu nome de ficheiro habitual"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Linux replacements for Windows programs"
msgstr "Ofrecer alternativas en Linux aos programas de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix box setup: distrobox mounts read-only folders wrong"
msgstr "Corrixir a configuración da caixa: distrobox monta mal os cartafoles de só lectura"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Fedora or Ubuntu versions of Windows programs"
msgstr "Ofrecer versións de Fedora ou Ubuntu dos programas de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer the Linux version when a Windows program is opened"
msgstr "Ofrecer a versión de Linux ao abrir un programa de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ship one shim, so firmware adds no extra Fedora entry"
msgstr "Incluír un só shim, para que o firmware non engada outra entrada de Fedora"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put Fedora's firewall zone back"
msgstr "Restaurar a zona do devasa de Fedora"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Harden root helpers, firewall and no-password updates"
msgstr "Reforzar os asistentes de root, o devasa e as actualizacións sen contrasinal"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Novos valores predeterminados: fondos de pantalla, cartafoles de cor de realce, pantalla de bloqueo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Novo valor predeterminado: cor de realce verde azulado, tamén na pantalla de inicio de sesión"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Corrixir a nota de reversión, o bucle de inicio de sesión e as probas atascadas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Corrixir a reversión por bloqueo e reducir os reintentos a 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Corrixir as probas de reversión automática"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Probas de fallo reais para a reversión automática"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Engadir reversión automática con greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Iniciar a disposición de Windows no escritorio, e pequenas correccións"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Pausar as actualizacións automáticas durante 3 días tras unha reversión"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Engadir un paso de Disposición do escritorio ao instalador"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Engadir Disposición do escritorio a Ferramentas do sistema"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Evitar que os cambios de modo de enerxía agarden polas actualizacións"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Engadir unha disposición opcional ao estilo de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Corrixir os axustes predefinidos de Fedora 45 e as rutas da política de contedores"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Ler as fontes de descarga no novo cartafol de Fedora 45"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Pasar a Fedora 45"

msgid "Fonts and text size are back to EvenKeelOS's own."
msgstr "Os tipos de letra e o tamaño do texto volveron aos propios de EvenKeelOS."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recommended: Delete the box. It comes back by itself the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another way is deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr "Recomendado: Eliminar a caixa. Volve por si soa a próxima vez que instale {apps}. Tamén se elimina todo o que se engadise á caixa doutro xeito. Os seus ficheiros non se tocan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deleting it frees about {size}."
msgstr "Eliminala libera uns {size}."
